IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `as65-nouns`
IMPORT `as65-cross-references`

-- Row il-65. The controls hold, and the recorded facts about the two items are what NOTES.md says they are.
-- The defects themselves are NOT asserted sound anywhere in this file: their four failing assertions are in as65-tests-xrefs-red.l4.
-- Every expected value is written from the texts quoted in as65-cross-references.l4, not from the output of the module.

§ `Tests of the sound controls`

-- I1 control: item (6) of s 31 cites s 3ג2, and the consolidation prints a heading with that name: 1 of 1.
#ASSERT `the target prints the name the citing words print` (`reference: item (6) of s 31, the words that cite s 3ג2`)
#ASSERT `the target has everything the citing words name` (`reference: item (6) of s 31, the words that cite s 3ג2`)
#ASSERT (`reference: item (6) of s 31, the words that cite s 3ג2`)'s `how many things the citing words name` EQUALS 1
#ASSERT (`reference: item (6) of s 31, the words that cite s 3ג2`)'s `how many of them the target has under that name` EQUALS 1
#ASSERT (`reference: item (6) of s 31, the words that cite s 3ג2`)'s `limb (a) was read from` EQUALS `the consolidation only`
#ASSERT (`reference: item (6) of s 31, the words that cite s 3ג2`)'s `limb (b) was read from` EQUALS `the official page, read from its image, and the cropped image is deposited`
-- I2 control: the places of (ב) outside paragraph (2), 3 of 3, hold the replaced string exactly in the earlier revision and the replacing words in the current one.
#ASSERT `the replaced string stands at every one of the places` (`instruction: item (6)(ב) of s 31 of the Act`) (`the places of (ב) outside paragraph (2)`)
#ASSERT `the replacing words stand at every one of the places` (`instruction: item (6)(ב) of s 31 of the Act`) (`the places of (ב) outside paragraph (2)`)
#ASSERT `how many of the places hold the replaced string exactly in revision 2968704` (`instruction: item (6)(ב) of s 31 of the Act`) (`the places of (ב) outside paragraph (2)`) EQUALS 3
#ASSERT `how many of the places hold the replacing words in revision 3085793` (`instruction: item (6)(ב) of s 31 of the Act`) (`the places of (ב) outside paragraph (2)`) EQUALS 3
#ASSERT count (`the places of (ב) outside paragraph (2)`) EQUALS 3

§ `Tests of what the records say (I1)`

-- The citing words print the shorter name, the target prints the longer one, and they are not the same string.
#ASSERT (`reference: the definition that cites s 36ט, in s 31(1)`)'s `the name as the citing words print it` EQUALS "רישיון נותן תשלום יציבותי"
#ASSERT (`reference: the definition that cites s 36ט, in s 31(1)`)'s `the name as the target prints it` EQUALS "רישיון נותן שירותי תשלום יציבותי"
#ASSERT NOT `the target prints the name the citing words print` (`reference: the definition that cites s 36ט, in s 31(1)`)
-- The reference names one licence, and the target has none under that name.
#ASSERT (`reference: the definition that cites s 36ט, in s 31(1)`)'s `how many things the citing words name` EQUALS 1
#ASSERT (`reference: the definition that cites s 36ט, in s 31(1)`)'s `how many of them the target has under that name` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT NOT `the target has everything the citing words name` (`reference: the definition that cites s 36ט, in s 31(1)`)
-- Where each limb was read from: the target from the consolidation only; the citing words from the official page, the crop deposited.
#ASSERT (`reference: the definition that cites s 36ט, in s 31(1)`)'s `limb (a) was read from` EQUALS `the consolidation only`
#ASSERT (`reference: the definition that cites s 36ט, in s 31(1)`)'s `limb (b) was read from` EQUALS `the official page, read from its image, and the cropped image is deposited`

§ `Tests of what the records say (I2)`

-- The instruction names one string, says it applies in every place, and gives one replacement; it was read from the official page, the crop deposited.
#ASSERT (`instruction: item (6)(ב) of s 31 of the Act`)'s `the string the instruction replaces` EQUALS "התאגיד הבנקאי או המבטח"
#ASSERT (`instruction: item (6)(ב) of s 31 of the Act`)'s `the words the instruction puts in its place` EQUALS "התאגיד הבנקאי, נותן הערבות האחר או המבטח"
#ASSERT (`instruction: item (6)(ב) of s 31 of the Act`)'s `how the instruction says it applies` EQUALS "in every place"
#ASSERT (`instruction: item (6)(ב) of s 31 of the Act`)'s `the instruction was read from` EQUALS `the official page, read from its image, and the cropped image is deposited`
-- There are five places in (ב), two of them in paragraph (2), and the places were read from the consolidation only.
#ASSERT count (`all the places of (ב)`) EQUALS 5
#ASSERT count (`the places of paragraph (2) of (ב)`) EQUALS 2
#ASSERT (`place: paragraph (2) of (ב), the first place`)'s `the places were read from` EQUALS `the consolidation only`
-- Paragraph (2): the replaced string stands at one place exactly and a prefixed spelling of it at the other, in the earlier revision.
#ASSERT `how many of the places hold the replaced string exactly in revision 2968704` (`instruction: item (6)(ב) of s 31 of the Act`) (`the places of paragraph (2) of (ב)`) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `how many of the places spell the words exactly in revision 2968704` (`the places of paragraph (2) of (ב)`) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `how many of the places spell the words with a prefix in revision 2968704` (`the places of paragraph (2) of (ב)`) EQUALS 1
-- Paragraph (2): the current revision prints the replacing words at one place, and the second place as it was.
#ASSERT `how many of the places hold the replacing words in revision 3085793` (`instruction: item (6)(ב) of s 31 of the Act`) (`the places of paragraph (2) of (ב)`) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT (`place: paragraph (2) of (ב), the second place`)'s `the words at the place in revision 3085793` EQUALS (`place: paragraph (2) of (ב), the second place`)'s `the words at the place in revision 2968704`
#ASSERT NOT ((`place: paragraph (2) of (ב), the second place`)'s `the words at the place in revision 2968704` EQUALS (`instruction: item (6)(ב) of s 31 of the Act`)'s `the string the instruction replaces`)
#ASSERT (`place: paragraph (2) of (ב), the first place`)'s `the words at the place in revision 2968704` EQUALS (`instruction: item (6)(ב) of s 31 of the Act`)'s `the string the instruction replaces`
#ASSERT (`place: paragraph (2) of (ב), the first place`)'s `the words at the place in revision 3085793` EQUALS (`instruction: item (6)(ב) of s 31 of the Act`)'s `the words the instruction puts in its place`
-- All five places: the replaced string stands exactly at 4 and the replacing words stand at 4, and the typed spelling of each place agrees with the comparison.
#ASSERT `how many of the places hold the replaced string exactly in revision 2968704` (`instruction: item (6)(ב) of s 31 of the Act`) (`all the places of (ב)`) EQUALS 4
#ASSERT `how many of the places hold the replacing words in revision 3085793` (`instruction: item (6)(ב) of s 31 of the Act`) (`all the places of (ב)`) EQUALS 4
#ASSERT `how many of the places spell the words exactly in revision 2968704` (`all the places of (ב)`) EQUALS `how many of the places hold the replaced string exactly in revision 2968704` (`instruction: item (6)(ב) of s 31 of the Act`) (`all the places of (ב)`)
#ASSERT NOT `the replaced string stands at every one of the places` (`instruction: item (6)(ב) of s 31 of the Act`) (`all the places of (ב)`)
#ASSERT NOT `the replaced string stands at every one of the places` (`instruction: item (6)(ב) of s 31 of the Act`) (`the places of paragraph (2) of (ב)`)
#ASSERT NOT `the replacing words stand at every one of the places` (`instruction: item (6)(ב) of s 31 of the Act`) (`the places of paragraph (2) of (ב)`)
